{"strongs": "H2374", "word": "חֹזֶה", "translit": "cho.zeh", "root": "חזה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "seer", "definition": "חֹזֶה noun masculine seer ; — absolute ׳ ח Amos 7:12 + 7 t.; construct חֹזֵה 1Chr 21:9 + 3 t.; חוֺזֵה 2Chr 35:15 plural חֹזִים Isa 29:10 + 4 t.; חוֺזִים 2Chr 33:19 (so read with ᵐ5 ; חוֺזָי֑ ᵑ0 scribal error) — 1. seer: \\ \\ a. of unnamed persons, synonym נבא(יםׅ 2Kgs 17:13 ; Isa 29:10 רֹאִים Isa 30:10 קֹסְמִים Mic 3:7 historical writers דִּבְרֵי הַחֹוִים 2Chr 33:18 , דברי חוזים ( ᵐ5 ) 2Chr 33:19 ( ᵑ0 apparently proper name) \\ \\ b. named prophets; Gad 2Sam 24:11 = 1Chr 21:9 ; 1Chr 29:29 ; 2Chr 29:25 Amos Amos 7:12 Iddo 2Chr 9:29 ; 2Chr 12:15 Jehu 2Chr 19:2 . \\ \\ c. the singers: Heman 1Chr 25:5 Asaph 2Chr 29:30 Jeduthun 2Chr 35:15 . Note — It seems best to add 2. vision (compare רֹאֶה Isa 28:7 ) עִם שְׁאוֺל עָשִׂינוּ חֹזֶה Isa 28:15 with She'Ùl we made a vision (had a vision, in connection with She'Ùl — i.e. by necromancy, see Du — which makes us secure; || כרת ברית אֶתמָֿוֶת ; Ew § 156 e transitive oracle here and 2Kgs 17:13 Hoffm ZAW iii. 95 puts this under 1: 'we have appointed a prophet with She'ol ( SS 'Ein bei der Scheol be-stellter Seher'), who is answerable to us for it;' ᵐ5 ᵑ9 ᵑ7 AV RV Che Di and others, are at (or have made an) agreement (prophetic advice of seers being taken at time of making treaties; see חָזוּת 1 ), — See also כָּלחֹֿזֶה proper name, masculine below כּל .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2661')\">BDB2661</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2374')\">H2374</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2335')\">H2335</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2660')\">BDB2660</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2662')\">BDB2662</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֹזֶה</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>seer</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 7:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,12)\">Amos 7:12</ref> + 7 t.; construct <bdbheb>חֹזֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,9)\">1Chr 21:9</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>חוֺזֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,15)\">2Chr 35:15</ref> plural <bdbheb>חֹזִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,10)\">Isa 29:10</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>חוֺזִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,19)\">2Chr 33:19</ref> (so read with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>; <bdbheb>חוֺזָי֑</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> scribal error) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>seer:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of unnamed persons, synonym <bdbheb>נבא(יםׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,13)\">2Kgs 17:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 29:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,10)\">Isa 29:10</ref> <bdbheb>רֹאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,10)\">Isa 30:10</ref> <bdbheb>קֹסְמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 3:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,7)\">Mic 3:7</ref> historical writers <bdbheb>דִּבְרֵי הַחֹוִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,18)\">2Chr 33:18</ref>, <bdbheb>דברי חוזים</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,19)\">2Chr 33:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> apparently proper name) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> named prophets; Gad <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,11)\">2Sam 24:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,9)\">1Chr 21:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:29\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,29)\">1Chr 29:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,25)\">2Chr 29:25</ref> Amos <ref ref=\"Amos 7:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,12)\">Amos 7:12</ref> Iddo <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:29\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,29)\">2Chr 9:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,15)\">2Chr 12:15</ref> Jehu <ref ref=\"2Chr 19:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,19,2)\">2Chr 19:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> the singers: Heman <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,5)\">1Chr 25:5</ref> Asaph <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:30\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,30)\">2Chr 29:30</ref> Jeduthun <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,15)\">2Chr 35:15</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>Note</b> — It seems best to add </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>vision</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>רֹאֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,7)\">Isa 28:7</ref>) <bdbheb>עִם שְׁאוֺל עָשִׂינוּ חֹזֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,15)\">Isa 28:15</ref> <highlight>with She'Ùl we made a vision</highlight> (had a vision, in connection with She'Ùl — i.e. by necromancy, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> — which makes us secure; || <bdbheb>כרת ברית אֶתמָֿוֶת</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew<sup>§ 156 e transitive</sup></lookup> <highlight>oracle</highlight> here and <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,13)\">2Kgs 17:13</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm<sup>ZAW iii. 95</sup></lookup> puts this under <b>1:</b> 'we have appointed a prophet with She'ol (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> 'Ein bei der Scheol be-stellter Seher'), who is answerable to us for it;' <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> and others, <highlight>are at</highlight> (or <highlight>have made an) agreement</highlight> (prophetic advice of seers being taken at time of making treaties; see  <bdbheb><reflink>חָזוּת</reflink></bdbheb> <b>1</b>), — See also <bdbheb>כָּלחֹֿזֶה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> below <bdbheb>כּל</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Amos 7:12", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Chr 21:9", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 29:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 29, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Chr 33:19", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 33, "verse